Package: GLS
Title: Structured Global-Local Shrinkage and Selection
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ying", "Wu", role = "aut"),
    person("Sheng", "Jiang", email = "jiangsheng@cuhk.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Implements global-local shrinkage and selection for edge-indexed
    multivariate count time series. The implementation combines a finite-shape
    negative-binomial approximation, Polya-Gamma augmentation, dynamic latent
    factors with a learned covariance discount, static propagation
    coefficients, learned graph-affinity scales, posterior diagnostics, joint
    decoupled shrinkage and selection, and sequential one-step prediction. A
    reproducible directed-grid simulation uses all ordered source-target pairs,
    periodic covariates, and PNAR benchmarks.
